03-2.html\" hreflang=\"mdh\" lang=\"mdh\" data-l=\"mdh\">Maguindanaon</a></nav>\n<footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir des deux Cheikhs · <a href=\"/mos/\">Accueil</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">À propos du projet</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Confidentialité et conditions</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n<script>try{localStorage.setItem(\"lang\",\"mos\")}catch(e){}document.addEventListener(\"click\",function(e){var a=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest(\"[data-l]\");if(a)try{localStorage.setItem(\"lang\",a.dataset.l)}catch(x){}})</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/103-3.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"mos\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir de Al-Asr 103:3 — selon Ibn Taymiyya et Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Rẽnda neb nins sẽn kõ-b sɩda, la b tʋm tʋʋm-sõmse, la b sagl taab ne sɩdã la b sagl taab ne sugri.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/mos/ayah/103-3.html\">\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,follow\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir de Al-Asr 103:3 — selon Ibn Taymiyya et Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Rẽnda neb nins sẽn kõ-b sɩda, la b tʋm tʋʋm-sõmse, la b sagl taab ne sɩdã la b sagl taab ne sugri.\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/mos/ayah/103-3.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Tafsir des deux Cheikhs\">\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"mos_BF\">\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\">\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\